list.item:
Prior to initiating teriflunomide tablets, screen patients for latent tuberculosis infection with a tuberculin skin test or blood test for mycobacterium tuberculosis infection [see 


                              Warnings and Precautions (5.4)
                           ].

Exclude pregnancy prior to initiation of treatment with teriflunomide tablets in females of reproductive potential [see 
                              Warnings and Precautions (5.2)
                           ].

Check blood pressure before start of teriflunomide tablets treatment and periodically thereafter [see 
                              Warnings and Precautions (5.10)
                           ].
